  "details": "Whenever the Standard Light shader is used on PC, the emissions will not show up in game on the PC version. On Quest or Android, the emissions show up perfectly fine.\n\nFurthermore, in Unity, saving will remove the emissions from the viewport. The emissions are still enabled on the material, but they don't display. This also happens when you go to upload the avatar, as the VRChat SDK tab automatically saves.",
